{"id":"u05","kelas":7,"no":5,"judul":"Sekolah dan Benda di Sekitar","title":"My School","emoji":"🏫","ringkas":"this/that, there is/are, dan preposisi tempat","ready":true,"goals":["menyebut benda di kelas dan tempat di sekolah","memakai [[this]], [[that]], [[these]], dan [[those]] untuk menunjuk benda","memakai [[there is]] dan [[there are]] untuk menyatakan ada","menyebut posisi benda dengan [[in]], [[on]], [[under]], [[next to]], [[behind]], dan lainnya","memahami perintah sederhana di kelas"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"**Unit 5** membawamu keliling **sekolah**. Kamu belajar menyebut benda di kelas, menunjuk benda yang dekat dan jauh, serta menjelaskan **di mana** sebuah benda berada."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Benda di kelas (Classroom objects)","items":[{"en":"book","id":"buku","ex":"Open your book."},{"en":"pen","id":"pulpen","ex":"I have a blue pen."},{"en":"pencil","id":"pensil","ex":"This is my pencil."},{"en":"eraser","id":"penghapus","ex":"Can I borrow your eraser?"},{"en":"ruler","id":"penggaris","ex":"The ruler is on the desk."},{"en":"bag","id":"tas","ex":"My bag is under the chair."},{"en":"desk","id":"meja (murid)","ex":"There is a book on the desk."},{"en":"chair","id":"kursi","ex":"Please sit on the chair."},{"en":"whiteboard","id":"papan tulis","ex":"The teacher writes on the whiteboard."},{"en":"map","id":"peta","ex":"There is a map on the wall."},{"en":"clock","id":"jam dinding","ex":"The clock is on the wall."},{"en":"window","id":"jendela","ex":"Please open the window."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Tempat di sekolah (Places at school)","items":[{"en":"classroom","id":"ruang kelas","ex":"Our classroom is big."},{"en":"library","id":"perpustakaan","ex":"I read books in the library."},{"en":"canteen","id":"kantin","ex":"We eat in the canteen."},{"en":"laboratory","id":"laboratorium","ex":"The science lab is on the second floor."},{"en":"field","id":"lapangan","ex":"We play football on the field."},{"en":"teachers' room","id":"ruang guru","ex":"Miss Sari is in the teachers' room."},{"en":"toilet","id":"toilet","ex":"Where is the toilet?"},{"en":"school yard","id":"halaman sekolah","ex":"We have a flag ceremony in the school yard."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. This, that, these, those","text":"Kata-kata ini dipakai untuk **menunjuk**. Pilihannya bergantung pada **jarak** (dekat atau jauh) dan **jumlah** (satu atau banyak).","table":[["","Dekat (di dekatmu)","Jauh (di sana)"],["**Satu** benda","**this** → [[This is my book.]]","**that** → [[That is a clock.]]"],["**Banyak** benda","**these** → [[These are my pens.]]","**those** → [[Those are windows.]]"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[This is a pencil.]] (dekat, satu)","id":"Ini pensil."},{"en":"[[Those are chairs.]] (jauh, banyak)","id":"Itu kursi-kursi."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Singkatan","text":"**That is** boleh disingkat menjadi **that's**. Contoh: [[That's my teacher.]] Tapi **this is** biasanya tidak disingkat."},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. There is dan there are","text":"Pakai untuk menyatakan sesuatu **ada**.\n• **There is** + benda **satu** (a/an)\n• **There are** + benda **banyak** (two, some, many)","table":[["Bentuk","Contoh"],["Positif","[[There is a library at my school.]] / [[There are two clocks in the room.]]"],["Negatif","[[There isn't a swimming pool.]] / [[There aren't any computers.]]"],["Pertanyaan","[[Is there a canteen?]] — Yes, there is. / [[Are there any books?]] — No, there aren't."]],"examples":[{"en":"[[How many chairs are there in your class?]] — [[There are thirty chairs.]]","id":"Ada berapa kursi di kelasmu? — Ada tiga puluh kursi."}]},{"t":"warn","title":"There is vs There are","text":"Lihat **bendanya**, bukan kata there. Benda satu → **is**: [[There is a book.]] Benda banyak → **are**: [[There are three books.]]"},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Menyebut posisi (Prepositions of place)","text":"Preposisi menjelaskan **di mana** benda berada, misalnya di atas, di bawah, atau di sebelah.","table":[["Preposisi","Artinya","Contoh"],["**in**","di dalam","[[The pen is in the bag.]]"],["**on**","di atas (menempel)","[[The book is on the desk.]]"],["**under**","di bawah","[[The bag is under the chair.]]"],["**next to**","di sebelah","[[The ruler is next to the pencil.]]"],["**between**","di antara (dua)","[[The eraser is between the pen and the pencil.]]"],["**in front of**","di depan","[[The teacher is in front of the class.]]"],["**behind**","di belakang","[[The field is behind the library.]]"],["**near**","dekat","[[The canteen is near the field.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. Perintah di kelas (Classroom instructions)","text":"Kalimat perintah dimulai dengan **kata kerja dasar**, tanpa subjek. Tambah **please** agar sopan.","table":[["Perintah","Artinya"],["[[Open your book, please.]]","Tolong buka bukumu."],["[[Close the door.]]","Tutup pintunya."],["[[Listen to the teacher.]]","Dengarkan guru."],["[[Don't talk.]] / [[Be quiet.]]","Jangan bicara. / Tenang."],["[[Raise your hand.]]","Angkat tanganmu."],["[[Come here.]] / [[Sit down.]]","Kemarilah. / Duduklah."],["[[Stand up.]]","Berdiri."]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Mencari benda","lines":[{"who":"Rani","en":"Excuse me, Budi. Is this your pen?","id":"Permisi, Budi. Apakah ini pulpenmu?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"No, it isn't. My pen is blue. Look in your bag.","id":"Bukan. Pulpenku biru. Cari di tasmu."},{"who":"Rani","en":"Oh, there are two pens in my bag! Here it is.","id":"Oh, ada dua pulpen di tasku! Ini dia."},{"who":"Budi","en":"Where is my ruler? It isn't on my desk.","id":"Di mana penggarisku? Tidak ada di mejaku."},{"who":"Rani","en":"It's under your chair!","id":"Ada di bawah kursimu!"}]},{"t":"summary","items":["**this/that** untuk satu benda, **these/those** untuk banyak benda. Dekat = this/these, jauh = that/those.","[[There is]] + satu benda, [[There are]] + banyak benda.","Posisi: [[in]], [[on]], [[under]], [[next to]], [[between]], [[in front of]], [[behind]], [[near]].","Perintah dimulai dengan kata kerja dasar: [[Open your book, please.]]"]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan benda dengan artinya:","pairs":[["ruler","penggaris"],["eraser","penghapus"],["whiteboard","papan tulis"],["library","perpustakaan"],["canteen","kantin"]],"exp":"Benda dan tempat di sekolah sering dipakai sehari-hari.","k":"7f0d9b32"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu menunjuk satu buku yang ada di dekatmu. Kamu bilang...","options":["This is a book.","That is a book.","These are books.","Those are books."],"answer":0,"exp":"Satu benda dekat = this.","k":"5b149f0c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu menunjuk dua jendela yang jauh. Kamu bilang...","options":["This is a window.","That is a window.","These are windows.","Those are windows."],"answer":3,"exp":"Banyak benda jauh = those.","k":"d11391ef"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ini pensil-pensilku.","q":"___ are my pencils. (dekat, banyak)","answers":["these"],"hint":"this / these ?","exp":"Banyak + dekat = these.","k":"fddc3672"},{"type":"fill","id":"Itu jam dinding. (jauh, satu)","q":"___ is a clock.","answers":["that"],"hint":"that / those ?","exp":"Satu + jauh = that.","k":"ac673432"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["There is two chairs.","There are two chairs.","There is chairs two.","There are a chair."],"answer":1,"exp":"Dua kursi = banyak, jadi There are.","k":"a6dd277d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["There are a library at my school.","There is a library at my school.","There is libraries at my school.","There are library at my school."],"answer":1,"exp":"A library = satu, jadi There is.","k":"1829a08a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apakah ada kantin di sekolahmu?","q":"___ there a canteen at your school?","answers":["is"],"hint":"is / are ?","exp":"Satu benda → Is there ...?","k":"3e52f76d"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Tasku ada di bawah kursi.\"","answer":"My bag is under the chair.","exp":"Benda + is + preposisi + tempat.","k":"1e3bc812"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Ada tiga buku di meja.\"","answer":"There are three books on the desk.","exp":"There are + jumlah + benda + tempat.","k":"7b770384"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Buku itu berada di dalam tas. Kita bilang...","options":["The book is on the bag.","The book is in the bag.","The book is under the bag.","The book is behind the bag."],"answer":1,"exp":"in = di dalam.","k":"7e63f8a6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Penghapus ada di antara pulpen dan pensil. Kita bilang...","options":["next to","between","behind","under"],"answer":1,"exp":"between = di antara dua benda.","k":"5e64bd8a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Di mana buku itu?","say":"The book is on the desk","options":["Di atas meja","Di bawah meja","Di dalam tas","Di belakang kursi"],"answer":0,"exp":"on = di atas.","k":"9db2c20a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa perintah gurumu?","say":"Open your book, please","options":["Tolong buka bukumu.","Tolong tutup bukumu.","Tolong angkat tanganmu.","Tolong berdiri."],"answer":0,"exp":"Open = buka; close = tutup.","k":"2a0b7558"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"Be quiet\"?","options":["Silakan masuk.","Tenang / diam.","Berdiri.","Dengarkan."],"answer":1,"exp":"Be quiet = tenang.","k":"61247891"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban singkat yang benar untuk \"Are there any computers in the lab?\" (ya) adalah...","options":["Yes, there is.","Yes, there are.","Yes, they are.","Yes, it is."],"answer":1,"exp":"Are there ...? → Yes, there are.","k":"c795fa4b"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan benda dengan artinya:","pairs":[["desk","meja murid"],["chair","kursi"],["bag","tas"],["clock","jam dinding"],["window","jendela"]],"exp":"Benda di kelas.","k":"e808dca4"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan tempat di sekolah dengan artinya:","pairs":[["library","perpustakaan"],["canteen","kantin"],["laboratory","laboratorium"],["field","lapangan"],["school yard","halaman sekolah"]],"exp":"Tempat di sekolah.","k":"c7fa7d66"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan preposisi dengan artinya:","pairs":[["in","di dalam"],["on","di atas"],["under","di bawah"],["behind","di belakang"],["near","dekat"]],"exp":"Preposisi tempat.","k":"29f44fa9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu menunjuk sebuah tas yang jauh. Kamu bilang...","options":["That is a bag.","This is a bag.","These are bags.","Those is a bag."],"answer":0,"exp":"Satu benda jauh = that.","k":"efda742d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu menunjuk tiga pensil di tanganmu. Kamu bilang...","options":["These are pencils.","This is pencils.","That is pencils.","Those is pencils."],"answer":0,"exp":"Banyak dan dekat = these.","k":"2403031c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["There are five books on the desk.","There is five books on the desk.","There be five books on the desk.","There five books on the desk."],"answer":0,"exp":"five books = banyak → are.","k":"427f8103"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["There isn't a library in my school.","There aren't a library in my school.","There not is a library in my school.","There isn't library in my school are."],"answer":0,"exp":"a library = satu → isn't.","k":"10638827"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["Are there any computers in the lab?","Is there any computers in the lab?","Are there a computers in the lab?","There are any computers in the lab?"],"answer":0,"exp":"computers jamak → Are there any ...?","k":"4ab26c45"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pensil ada di sebelah penghapus. Kita bilang...","options":["The pencil is next to the eraser.","The pencil is at the eraser next.","The pencil next to is the eraser.","The pencil is in the eraser."],"answer":0,"exp":"next to = di sebelah.","k":"1d73508a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Papan tulis ada di depan kelas. Kita bilang...","options":["The whiteboard is in front of the class.","The whiteboard is behind of the class.","The whiteboard is under the class.","The whiteboard in front is class."],"answer":0,"exp":"in front of = di depan.","k":"6049cc13"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"Sit down, please\" adalah...","options":["Silakan duduk.","Silakan berdiri.","Silakan keluar.","Silakan bicara."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sit down = duduk.","k":"a56adb38"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ada sebuah peta di dinding.","q":"There ___ a map on the wall.","answers":["is"],"hint":"is / are ?","exp":"a map = satu → is.","k":"6cf5e7d4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ada dua jam di kelas.","q":"There ___ two clocks in the classroom.","answers":["are"],"hint":"is / are ?","exp":"two clocks = banyak → are.","k":"127fd49e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tasku ada di bawah meja.","q":"My bag is ___ the desk.","answers":["under"],"hint":"u _ _ _ _","exp":"under = di bawah.","k":"3eecf217"},{"type":"fill","id":"Buku itu ada di dalam tas.","q":"The book is ___ the bag.","answers":["in"],"hint":"i _","exp":"in = di dalam.","k":"ed0cd868"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Ada sebuah perpustakaan di sekolahku.\"","answer":"There is a library in my school.","exp":"There is + a + benda + tempat.","k":"09981bc4"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Tolong buka bukumu.\"","answer":"Please open your book.","exp":"Please + kata kerja dasar + ...","k":"20ef0e1a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Di mana tas itu?","say":"The bag is on the chair","options":["Di atas kursi","Di bawah kursi","Di sebelah kursi","Di belakang kursi"],"answer":0,"exp":"on = di atas.","k":"1cdaa639"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa perintahnya?","say":"Close the window please","options":["Tolong tutup jendela","Tolong buka jendela","Tolong tutup pintu","Tolong duduk"],"answer":0,"exp":"Close = tutup.","k":"98ee29be"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"My classroom is big. There are thirty chairs and fifteen desks. There is a whiteboard in front of the class.\" Ada berapa kursi?","options":["Tiga puluh","Lima belas","Tiga belas","Lima puluh"],"answer":0,"exp":"thirty chairs.","k":"01a93830"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"There is a library next to the canteen. There is a field behind the library.\" Lapangan ada di mana?","options":["Di belakang perpustakaan","Di sebelah kantin","Di depan kantin","Di atas perpustakaan"],"answer":0,"exp":"behind the library.","k":"e9d9b695"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"My bag is on the chair. My pencil case is in my bag. My book is under the desk.\" Di mana buku itu?","options":["Di bawah meja","Di dalam tas","Di atas kursi","Di sebelah meja"],"answer":0,"exp":"under the desk.","k":"71127130"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Is this your pen?\" B: \"No, it isn't. ___ pen is blue.\"","options":["My","I","Me","Mine is"],"answer":0,"exp":"My pen.","k":"cc7b253a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Are there any computers in the lab?\" B: \"___\"","options":["Yes, there are.","Yes, there is.","Yes, they is.","Yes, it is."],"answer":0,"exp":"Are there ...? → Yes, there are.","k":"6aaa3696"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["There is two books on the desk.","There are two books on the desk.","There is a book on the desk.","There are some books on the desk."],"answer":0,"exp":"two books → are.","k":"61997aed"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["These is my pencil.","This is my pencil.","These are my pencils.","That is my pencil."],"answer":0,"exp":"These → are.","k":"05db95c5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["The ruler is in the desk. (di atas meja)","The ruler is on the desk.","The ruler is under the desk.","The ruler is next to the desk."],"answer":0,"exp":"di atas meja → on.","k":"941c8887"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Tolong tutup pintunya\" adalah...","options":["Please close the door.","Please closing the door.","Please you close door.","Closed the door please."],"answer":0,"exp":"Please + kata kerja dasar.","k":"d6f188ac"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Ada sebuah jam di dinding\" adalah...","options":["There is a clock on the wall.","There are a clock on the wall.","It has a clock wall.","Clock there is on wall."],"answer":0,"exp":"There is a ...","k":"18740057"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tidak sama kelompoknya adalah...","options":["library","ruler","eraser","pencil"],"answer":0,"exp":"library = tempat; lainnya alat tulis.","k":"8b621b82"},{"type":"fill","id":"Itu kursi-kursi. (jauh, banyak)","q":"___ are chairs.","answers":["those"],"hint":"this / those ?","exp":"Banyak + jauh → those.","k":"4fa123a0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ini sebuah penghapus. (dekat, satu)","q":"___ is an eraser.","answers":["this"],"hint":"this / that ?","exp":"Satu + dekat → this.","k":"088ad2c3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Buku ada di atas meja.","q":"The book is ___ the desk.","answers":["on"],"hint":"o _","exp":"on = di atas.","k":"b99d03d4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Perpustakaan ada di sebelah kantin.","q":"The library is ___ to the canteen.","answers":["next"],"hint":"n _ _ _","exp":"next to.","k":"51b4bd04"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Ada dua puluh siswa di kelas.\"","answer":"There are twenty students in the class.","exp":"There are + jumlah + students.","k":"eeadf9ae"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Jangan berisik di perpustakaan.\"","answer":"Don't make noise in the library.","exp":"Don't + kata kerja dasar.","k":"0cd7ec71"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Di mana pensil itu?","say":"The pencil is between the pen and the ruler","options":["Di antara pulpen dan penggaris","Di atas pulpen","Di bawah penggaris","Di dalam tas"],"answer":0,"exp":"between.","k":"551ad0c1"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa perintahnya?","say":"Stand up and sit down","options":["Berdiri lalu duduk","Duduk lalu berdiri","Berlari lalu berhenti","Buka lalu tutup"],"answer":0,"exp":"Stand up; sit down.","k":"7207639d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Kamu ingin meminjam penggaris temanmu. Apa yang kamu katakan?","options":["Can I borrow your ruler, please?","Give me ruler.","I take your ruler.","Your ruler me."],"answer":0,"exp":"Can I borrow.","k":"503dc809"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Guru berkata, \"Open your books to page ten.\" Apa yang harus kamu lakukan?","options":["Membuka buku ke halaman sepuluh","Menutup buku","Menyimpan buku","Membeli buku"],"answer":0,"